  "source": "plan-proposal",
  "source_detail": "PLAN.md Q4",
  "explanation": "Three moments upkeep could run, all after an agent changes code. The recommendation is [the end of the agent's turn](#endturn), because the agent that made the change is still there to fix the router. [A commit check](#commit) has no agent to fix anything, and [a command run by hand](#manual) isn't automatic. Leaves out how a router is judged false, which is the next question.",
